## ── Context ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
##
## Arbor is a fully native Rust desktop app for agentic coding workflows.
## It has: daemon (arbor-httpd), CLI (arbor-cli), MCP server (arbor-mcp),
## desktop GUI (arbor-gui), and a web dashboard (arbor-web-ui).
## All communicate with `arbor-httpd` as a shared daemon.
##
## b00t can integrate with Arbor WITHOUT modifying Arbor's source code,
## by using Arbor's existing daemon API, MCP protocol, and CLI interface.
##
## Architecture:
##
##   ┌─────────────────────┐     MCP stdio      ┌──────────────────┐
##   │  Agent (Claude/etc) │◄───────────────────│  arbor-mcp       │
##   └─────────────────────┘                    │  (existing)      │
##                                              └────────┬─────────┘
##                                                       │ HTTP
##                                              ┌────────▼─────────┐
##                                              │  arbor-httpd     │
##                                              │  (daemon)        │
##                                              └──┬────┬────┬─────┘
##                                      ┌──────────┘    │    └──────────┐
##                               ┌──────▼─────┐  ┌──────▼─────┐  ┌─────▼──────┐
##                               │ arbor-cli   │  │ arbor-gui  │  │ b00t-arbor │
##                               │ (existing)  │  │ (existing) │  │ (NEW)      │
##                               └─────────────┘  └─────────────┘  └────────────┘
##
## The bridge crate `b00t-arbor` wraps Arbor's daemon API → b00t datums.

## ── Integration surface ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Immediate wins (zero Arbor code changes)

| layer | what | effort | value | status |
|-------|------|--------|-------|--------|
| datum | Register arbor-mcp as a b00t `.mcp.toml` datum | 5 min | HIGH | 🆕 TODO |
| datum | Add arbor-mcp to `--mcp=recommended` pipeline | 5 min | HIGH | 🆕 TODO |
| datum | Add `[[b00t.gate]] command = "arbor-mcp"` gate | 5 min | MED | 🆕 TODO |
| guard | Arbor worktree `git checkout` → evaluated by b00t hive guards | 0 min (already works) | MED | ✅ existing |
| cli | `b00t arbor <cmd>` passthrough via `arbor-cli` | 30 min | MED | 🆕 TODO |
| observability | `b00t observability` reads Arbor daemon API for agent state | 2 hr | MED | 🆕 TODO |

### Bridge crate (`b00t-arbor`, moderate effort, no Arbor changes)

| crate | what | effort | value |
|-------|------|--------|-------|
| b00t-arbor | HTTP client for arbor-httpd REST API | 4 hr | HIGH |
| b00t-arbor/src/worktrees.rs | List/create/delete worktrees from b00t | 2 hr | MED |
| b00t-arbor/src/agents.rs | Read agent activity (Claude/Codex/OpenCode state) | 1 hr | MED |
| b00t-arbor/src/tasks.rs | Trigger Arbor tasks from b00t job workflows | 3 hr | LOW |
| b00t-arbor/src/guards.rs | Push b00t guard violations → Arbor notifications | 2 hr | MED |

### Deep integration (requires Arbor patches, high effort)

| change | what | effort |
|--------|------|--------|
| Arbor reads `_b00t_/*.toml` for config | Datum schema → `arbor.toml` mapping | 1 week |
| Arbor embeds b00t rhai engine for hooks | `rhai::Engine` init + scope injection | 1 week |
| Arbor agent visibility → b00t hive gossip | Protobuf + mDNS | 2 weeks |
| Arbor tasks ↔ b00t jobs bidirectional | Schema alignment | 1 week |

