## ── API surface (arbor-httpd) ────────────────────────────────────────────────

| endpoint | method | returns | used by |
|----------|--------|--------|---------|
| `/health` | GET | `{"status":"ok"}` | b00t-arbor ping check |
| `/api/worktrees` | GET | `[{id, repo, branch, path, last_git_activity}]` | b00t arbor worktrees list |
| `/api/worktrees` | POST | `{id, path}` | b00t checkpoint --worktree |
| `/api/worktrees/{id}` | DELETE | `{}` | b00t arbor worktrees delete |
| `/api/agents` | GET | `[{name, status, session_id}]` | b00t arbor agents status |
| `/api/processes` | GET | `[{name, status, memory}]` | b00t arbor processes list |
| `/api/tasks` | GET | `[{name, schedule, enabled}]` | b00t arbor tasks list |

Environment:
- `ARBOR_DAEMON_URL` (default: `http://127.0.0.1:8787`)
- `ARBOR_DAEMON_AUTH_TOKEN` (optional, for remote daemons)

